    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE GAMES</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662310/extras/c532089f4795a7106eaa5b1e851f3af2.avif?t=1670009235\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Junkman Simulator</strong></h2><strong><br>Build Your Junkyard by Earned Money! Earn money by Cleaning Scraps, Explore New Areas,<br>Build and Repair Your Car and Start Exploring,<br>Adopt Pet, Build Machines and Geneartors,Convert Scraps to Metals and Sell Customers! Hang Out In City!<br>Find Special Hidden Objects and Build Your House, Delivery Metals Your Customers, Repair Customers Broken Cars.</strong><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Look At Features and Game!</h2></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Repair Cars</strong></h2>Buy Car Parts and Repair Customers Cars and Earn Money!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clean Junkyard and Scraps!</strong></h2>Clean Scraps and Earn Money Them!<br>Buy Scrap Generator For More Scraps!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade/Build Your Junkyard</strong></h2>Buy New Machines and Repair Your Car and Start Adventure!<br>Junkyard is important! It's your workplace!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Decorate Your House</strong></h2>Decorate Your House, Buy New Furnitures...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deliver Your Orders!</strong></h2>Convert Your Scraps to Metal and Deliver Metals to Customers..<br>Customers like to order metal.<br>You can track your sales from the computer!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1662310/extras/c532089f4795a7106eaa5b1e851f3af2.avif?t=1670009235\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Junkman Simulator</strong></h2><strong><br>Build Your Junkyard by Earned Money! Earn money by Cleaning Scraps, Explore New Areas,<br>Build and Repair Your Car and Start Exploring,<br>Adopt Pet, Build Machines and Geneartors,Convert Scraps to Metals and Sell Customers! Hang Out In City!<br>Find Special Hidden Objects and Build Your House, Delivery Metals Your Customers, Repair Customers Broken Cars.</strong><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Look At Features and Game!</h2></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Repair Cars</strong></h2>Buy Car Parts and Repair Customers Cars and Earn Money!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Clean Junkyard and Scraps!</strong></h2>Clean Scraps and Earn Money Them!<br>Buy Scrap Generator For More Scraps!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade/Build Your Junkyard</strong></h2>Buy New Machines and Repair Your Car and Start Adventure!<br>Junkyard is important! It's your workplace!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Decorate Your House</strong></h2>Decorate Your House, Buy New Furnitures...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deliver Your Orders!</strong></h2>Convert Your Scraps to Metal and Deliver Metals to Customers..<br>Customers like to order metal.<br>You can track your sales from the computer!",
